t twitter and and you tube and very concerned about radicalization review tube but uh... as well so there there are rules of the road that we should be working on a protect privacy empower parents ensure that these are american company subject to the jurisdiction of the united states are at least our allies europe places that uh... share democratic values so on It's been tough because we try to pass it through and it doesn't seem to happen, but you got one vote in me to try to bring these things right in.",
